@startuml
actor User
participant "Analyse page" as Frontend
participant "FastAPI route" as API
participant "AnalyseRequirementUseCase" as UC
participant "RequirementRepository" as Repo
participant "AIGateway" as Gateway
participant "Gemini" as Gemini

User -> Frontend : Request analysis
Frontend -> API : POST /requirements/{id}/analyse
API -> UC : execute(id)
UC -> Repo : get_by_id(id)
Repo --> UC : Requirement
UC -> Gateway : analyse(text)
Gateway -> Gemini : analysis request
Gemini --> Gateway : quality + issues
Gateway --> UC : AIAnalysis
UC -> Requirement : mark_analyzed()
UC -> Repo : save(Requirement)
Repo --> UC : success
UC --> API : AIAnalysis + status
API --> Frontend : JSON response
Frontend --> User : Show analysis result

note over UC,Repo
AI analysis changes the lifecycle to Analyzed,
but does not make a human validation decision.
end note
@enduml
